---
Config loader support for top-level hooks key. Format mirrors Claude Code: {hooks: {PreToolUse: [{matcher: 'Bash', hooks: [{type: 'command', command: '...', timeout: 30}]}]}}. Also support .clawq/hooks.json file (Codex-style events at root level).